{"sha": "cb9b3ac6465d30b02d242750389dc49f93847e781ffaf4af50c5e9d109515db3", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:contdist} 章 --- 连续型随机变量}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:1}", "$\\P(X \\leq 5) = \\frac{5}{15} = \\frac13$;", "$\\P(4 \\leq X \\leq 10) = \\frac{6}{15} = \\frac25$;", "$\\E(X) = \\frac{15}{2} = 7.5$ 分钟；", "$\\sigma(X) = \\frac{15}{\\sqrt{12}} = \\frac{5\\sqrt3}{2} \\approx 4.3$ 分钟。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:2}", "$f \\geq 0$ 且", "$\\int_0^2 \\frac38 t^2\\,\\dd t = \\frac38\\left[\\frac{t^3}{3}\\right]_0^2", "= \\frac38 \\times \\frac83 = 1$：是一个概率密度。", "\\[", "\\E(X) = \\int_0^2 \\frac38 t^3\\,\\dd t = \\frac38 \\times \\frac{16}{4} = \\frac32,", "\\qquad", "\\P(X \\geq 1) = \\int_1^2 \\frac38 t^2\\,\\dd t = \\frac{8 - 1}{8} = \\frac78 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:3}", "\\emph{1.} $\\E(X) = \\frac{1}{0.2} = 5$ 年；", "$\\P(X > 5) = \\eu^{-0.2\\times5} = \\eu^{-1} \\approx 0.37$.", "", "\\emph{2.} 由无记忆性（\\cref{thm:g12:contdist:memoryless}）可得，", "$\\pcond{X > 3}{X > 8} = \\P(X > 5) = \\eu^{-1} \\approx 0.37$：已服役的三年", "并不改变任何结果。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:4}", "$\\P(X > m) = \\eu^{-\\lambda m} = \\frac12$ 给出", "$m = \\frac{\\ln 2}{\\lambda} \\approx \\frac{0.69}{\\lambda}$，小于", "$\\E(X) = \\frac1\\lambda$。指数分布的概率密度具有较长的右尾：少数异常长的寿命", "把\\emph{平均数}拉到", "\\emph{中位数}之上，即总体中有一半超过的那个值。（这正是", "\\cref{ex:g12:exp:halflife}中的半衰期：一半原子能", "存活过该时间，尽管平均寿命更长。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:5}", "$168 = \\mu - \\sigma$ 且 $182 = \\mu + \\sigma$：约 $68\\%$。", "$189 = \\mu + 2\\sigma$：其上方占剩余部分", "$100 - 95.4 = 4.6\\%$ 的一半，因此约为 $2.3\\%$。", "$154 = \\mu - 3\\sigma$：约为 $\\frac{100 - 99.7}{2} = 0.15\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:6}", "$\\P(X < 500) \\leq 2.5\\%$ 意味着 $500$ 至少要比均值低", "两个标准差（正态分布的 $2.3\\% \\approx 2.5\\%$ 落在", "$\\mu - 2\\sigma$ 以下；若取常用值 $1.96$，推理完全相同）：", "\\[", "\\mu - 2\\sigma \\geq 500 \\iff \\mu \\geq 500 + 8 = 508 \\text{ 克}.", "\\]", "机器必须平均设定为 $508$ 克 --- 这一保证的", "代价是每袋多出 $8$ 克的“免费”产品。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:7}", "\\emph{1.} 取 $p = \\frac16$，$n = 1200$：", "$\\sqrt{\\frac{p(1-p)}{n}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{5/36}{1200}} \\approx 0.0108$，因此", "$95\\%$ 的波动区间为", "\\[", "\\frac16 \\pm 1.96 \\times 0.0108 \\approx \\intcc{0.146}{0.188}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} 观测频率 $\\frac{260}{1200} \\approx 0.217$ 远远落在", "区间之外：在 $5\\%$ 水平下拒绝公平性假设。", "偏差约为 $4.6$ 个标准差 --- 若用正态近似，", "概率的量级为 $10^{-6}$，远胜于", "比内–切比雪夫不等式给出的 $\\leq 4.6\\%$ 的上界", "（见\\cref{exo:g12:sums:7}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:8}", "\\emph{1.} 误差范围 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt n} \\leq 0.02$ 需要", "$n \\geq 2500$ 人。", "", "\\emph{2.} 要区分相差 $1$ 分的两个得分，误差范围必须", "远小于 $0.5$ 分，按简化公式需要 $n \\geq \\left(\\frac{1}{0.005}\\right)^2 =", "40\\,000$ 人，对大多数民意调查来说已不切实际 ---", "更糟的是，统计误差范围只反映\\emph{抽样}误差；", "系统性偏差（样本缺乏代表性、无应答、临近投票时的", "摇摆等）不会随 $n$ 增大而缩小，通常超过 1 分。", "相差 $1$ 分的竞争确实难分胜负。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:contdist:9}", "\\emph{1.} 由于 $\\alpha > 0$，$c \\leq \\alpha X + \\beta \\leq d", "\\iff \\frac{c - \\beta}{\\alpha} \\leq X \\leq \\frac{d - \\beta}{\\alpha}$，因此", "\\[", "\\P(c \\leq Y \\leq d)", "= \\int_{(c-\\beta)/\\alpha}^{(d-\\beta)/\\alpha} f(t)\\,\\dd t .", "\\]", "作代换 $y = \\alpha t + \\beta$（即在 $y$", "变量下读取面积，$t = \\frac{y - \\beta}{\\alpha}$，$\\dd t = \\frac{\\dd y}{\\alpha}$）", "于是化为", "$\\int_c^d \\frac{1}{\\alpha} f\\left(\\frac{y-\\beta}{\\alpha}\\right)\\dd y$：", "函数 $g(y) = \\frac1\\alpha f\\left(\\frac{y-\\beta}{\\alpha}\\right)$ 是", "$Y$ 的一个概率密度。", "", "\\emph{2.} 取 $f = \\varphi$，$\\alpha = \\sigma$，$\\beta = \\mu$：", "\\[", "g(y) = \\frac{1}{\\sigma}\\,\\varphi\\!\\left(\\frac{y - \\mu}{\\sigma}\\right)", "= \\frac{1}{\\sigma\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\,", "\\exp\\left(-\\frac{(y-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right),", "\\]", "因此它恰是", "$\\mathcal N(\\mu, \\sigma^2) = \\mu + \\sigma\\,\\mathcal N(0,1)$ 的概率密度。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}